options.customCss:
:root {
	/* Typography */
	--font-family: 'Open Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
	--font-weight-normal: 400;
	--font-weight-bold: 600;
	--font-size-body: 13px;
	--font-size-label: 14px;
	--font-size-test-notice: 12px;
	--font-size-input: 14px;
	--font-size-header: 24px;
	--font-size-paragraph: 14px;
	--font-size-link: 12px;
	--font-size-error: 12px;
	--font-size-html-h1: 28px;
	--font-size-html-h2: 22px;
	--font-size-html-h3: 18px;
	--font-size-html-h4: 16px;
	--font-size-html-h5: 14px;
	--font-size-html-h6: 12px;
	--font-size-subheader: 14px;

	/* Portfolio colors */
	--color-background: #020617;
	--color-card-bg: #081022;
	--color-card-border: #1e2a44;
	--color-card-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);

	--color-header: #f8fafc;
	--color-header-subtext: #a8b6cc;
	--color-label: #dbe7f7;
	--color-link: #00c8ff;
	--color-html-text: #dbe7f7;
	--color-html-link: #00c8ff;

	--color-input-bg: #0d172b;
	--color-input-border: #263650;
	--color-input-text: #e8f1ff;
	--color-focus-border: #00c8ff;

	--color-submit-btn-bg: #00c8ff;
	--color-submit-btn-text: #020617;

	--color-error: #fb7185;
	--color-required: #00c8ff;
	--color-clear-button-bg: #64748b;

	--color-test-notice-text: #fbbf24;
	--color-test-notice-bg: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08);
	--color-test-notice-border: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.28);

	/* Shape */
	--border-radius-card: 12px;
	--border-radius-input: 7px;
	--border-radius-clear-btn: 50%;
	--card-border-radius: 12px;

	/* Spacing */
	--padding-container-top: 48px;
	--padding-card: 32px;
	--padding-test-notice-vertical: 12px;
	--padding-test-notice-horizontal: 18px;
	--margin-bottom-card: 16px;
	--padding-form-input: 12px;
	--card-padding: 32px;
	--card-margin-bottom: 16px;

	/* Dimensions */
	--container-width: 520px;
	--submit-btn-height: 48px;
	--checkbox-size: 18px;

	/* Effects */
	--box-shadow-card:
		0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28),
		0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.025);
	--opacity-placeholder: 0.55;
}

/* Page background */
body {
	min-height: 100vh;
	color: var(--color-html-text);
	background:
		radial-gradient(
			circle at 50% -10%,
			rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.09),
			transparent 35rem
		),
		#020617;
}

/* Form container */
.container {
	padding-left: 16px;
	padding-right: 16px;
	padding-bottom: 48px;
}

/* Main form card */
.card {
	overflow: hidden;
	backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}

/* Form heading */
.form-header {
	text-align: center;
}

.form-header h1 {
	font-weight: 600;
	line-height: 1.25;
	letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.form-header p {
	max-width: 390px;
	margin: 0 auto;
	color: var(--color-header-subtext);
	line-height: 1.65;
}

/* Field layout */
.inputs-wrapper {
	text-align: left;
}

form label,
.form-label {
	color: var(--color-label);
	font-weight: 600;
}

/* Text fields */
input,
textarea,
select {
	color-scheme: dark;
	transition:
		border-color 150ms ease,
		box-shadow 150ms ease,
		background-color 150ms ease;
}

input:hover,
textarea:hover,
select:hover {
	border-color: #3a4d6d;
}

input:focus,
textarea:focus,
select:focus {
	border-color: var(--color-focus-border) !important;
	box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.14) !important;
	outline: none;
}

input::placeholder,
textarea::placeholder {
	color: #8291a8;
	opacity: 0.7;
}

/* Checkboxes and radio buttons */
input[type='checkbox'],
input[type='radio'] {
	accent-color: #00c8ff;
}

/* Submit button */
#submit-btn {
	border: 1px solid #00c8ff;
	border-radius: 7px;
	font-weight: 600;
	letter-spacing: 0.01em;
	box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.16);
	transition:
		transform 150ms ease,
		background-color 150ms ease,
		border-color 150ms ease,
		box-shadow 150ms ease;
}

#submit-btn:hover {
	background-color: #34d5ff;
	border-color: #34d5ff;
	box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.24);
	transform: translateY(-1px);
}

#submit-btn:active {
	transform: translateY(0);
}

#submit-btn:focus-visible {
	outline: 3px solid rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.3);
	outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* Links */
a {
	color: #00c8ff;
	text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

a:hover {
	color: #67e3ff;
}

/* Separators */
hr {
	border-color: #1e2a44;
}

/* Test-mode notice */
.test-notice {
	box-shadow: none;
}

/* n8n attribution */
.n8n-link {
	opacity: 0.65;
}

.n8n-link a:hover {
	color: #00c8ff;
	opacity: 1;
}

/* Mobile layout */
@media only screen and (max-width: 500px) {
	:root {
		--padding-container-top: 20px;
		--padding-card: 22px;
	}

	.container {
		width: 100%;
		padding: 20px 14px 36px;
	}

	.card {
		padding: var(--padding-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
		border-radius: var(--border-radius-card);
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-card);
	}

	.form-header::before {
		width: 68px;
		height: 68px;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.form-header h1 {
		font-size: 22px;
	}
}

/* Make pasted job listings easy to review */
textarea {
	min-height: 260px;
	resize: vertical;
}

parameters.text:
==Create a tailored resume for the following validated job posting.

<candidate_profile>
Full name: {{ $json.full_name }}
City: {{ $json.city }}
State/region: {{ $json.state }}
Phone: {{ $json.phone }}
Email: {{ $json.email }}
Website: {{ $json.website }}
LinkedIn: {{ $json.linkedin }}
</candidate_profile>

<validated_job>
Job posting source:
{{ $('Normalize Job Listing').item.json.source_url || 'Pasted directly into the form' }}

Employer:
{{ $json.output.company_name }}

Job title:
{{ $json.output.job_title }}
</validated_job>

<job_posting>
{{ $('Normalize Job Listing').item.json.job_content }}
</job_posting>

Analyze the employer’s responsibilities, qualifications, technologies, and priorities.

Retrieve the relevant verified information through the connected Notion tools and return the completed resume through the Structured Output Parser.

Use the candidate profile values as the sole source for the resume header.

When processing the Notion records:

* Use `Role Title` as the official employment title.
* Never use `Chapter` as a job title.
* Exclude archived skills.
* Respect each skill’s documented `Level`.
* Include only credentials whose status is `Completed`.
* Preserve each credential’s documented `Type`.
* Keep projects, independent learning, and professional employment clearly separated.

Do not include a qualification merely because it appears in the job posting. Every claim about the candidate must be supported by the candidate profile or information retrieved from the connected Notion tools during this execution.

parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "company_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The canonical employer name."
    },
    "job_title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The target position title."
    },
    "resume_markdown": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The complete tailored Markdown resume."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "company_name",
    "job_title",
    "resume_markdown"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}

{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "success",
        "validation_failed"
      ],
      "description": "Whether the content is a complete and usable job posting."
    },
    "company_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The employer name. Use an empty string when validation fails."
    },
    "job_title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The advertised job title. Use an empty string when validation fails."
    },
    "validation_message": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "A concise failure reason. Leave empty when validation succeeds."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "status",
    "company_name",
    "job_title",
    "validation_message"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
